# Source clips for the hero mosaic, copied from the LfO benchmark SSD.
# Kept locally so the mosaic can be rebuilt without remounting the drive.
# ~359 MB — never commit these; the built result (assets/video/hero-mosaic.mp4)
# is what the site actually ships.
assets/mosaic_src/

# Full-size originals for the ten Tasks-section clip pairs, copied off the same
# SSD. ~77 MB — the built results (assets/video/tasks/*.mp4, ~2 MB) are what the
# site ships and those ARE committed. Drop a replacement in here as
# <slug>-robot.mp4 and re-run tools/build_task_videos.sh.
assets/task_src/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Manim render environment. The scene source, fonts and source stills ARE
# committed; the venv (~480 MB) and intermediate renders are not. Rebuild with:
#   python3 -m venv tools/anim/.venv && tools/anim/.venv/bin/pip install manim
#   tools/anim/build.sh
tools/anim/.venv/
tools/anim/.render/
